    "description": "<p>Fate smiles on children and fools, and the fortunate reveler has aspects of both. The way he stumbles and bumbles around, evaluating walls as privies and pondering the hidden natures of everyday things, he should be a simple target. Unfortunately for his opponents, this uncoordinated nature protects him as he stops without warning or bends over to look at an interesting bug. Activating this Charm adds half the character's total penalties from indulgence to his Dodge DV against a single attack.</p>",
